Output m2.gif

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 16
Set FontFamily "FiraCodeMono"
Set Width 960
Set Height 640
Set Padding 20
Set Margin 4
Set BorderRadius 4
Set TypingSpeed 120ms
Set WindowBar Colorful

Enter
Type "date"
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Type "df -H"
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Type "sudo find / | head -n 10"
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Sleep 5s
